Recommends: iproute2
Suggests: docker.io
Description: private Raspberry Pi monitoring and media backup API
 PiStats Backend provides a bearer-token-protected HTTP API for Raspberry Pi
 monitoring, Wake-on-LAN, and optional idempotent media backup. Optional
 services and storage locations are selected by each installation.
